1
00:00:00,165 --> 00:00:02,235
(Amy:)You know, I'm sorry your
mother made you feel bad.

2
00:00:02,233 --> 00:00:04,733
(Amy:)But, you know, at the end
of the day, she was wrong,

3
00:00:04,736 --> 00:00:07,666
(Amy:)because you're not alone.

4
00:00:07,672 --> 00:00:09,372
(Sheldon:)You're right.

5
00:00:09,374 --> 00:00:11,474
(Sheldon:)I have Leonard
and Howard and Raj,

6
00:00:11,476 --> 00:00:14,276
(Sheldon:)Stuart, Penny,

7
00:00:14,279 --> 00:00:17,109
(Sheldon:)Leonard's mom, Bernadette,
Wil Wheaton...

8
00:00:17,115 --> 00:00:20,315
(Amy:)What about the woman who just
buttered your big flat feet?

9
00:00:21,152 --> 00:00:23,952
(Sheldon:)I was going chronologically.

10
00:00:23,955 --> 00:00:25,885
(Sheldon:)You're right between
Koothrappali's father

11
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,930
(Sheldon:)and Omar, the one-eyed
Sparkletts guy.

12
00:00:28,927 --> 00:00:31,757
(Amy:)Well, let's try to not let it
ruin the rest of our trip.

13
00:00:31,763 --> 00:00:33,493
(Sheldon:)I knew we should've
never mentioned

14
00:00:33,498 --> 00:00:36,268
(Sheldon:)us living together
in the first place.

15
00:00:36,267 --> 00:00:37,897
(Amy:)She was gonna find out
eventually.

16
00:00:37,902 --> 00:00:39,132
(Sheldon:)Disagree.

17
00:00:39,137 --> 00:00:41,407
(Sheldon:)We've known about evolution
since 1859.

18
00:00:41,406 --> 00:00:45,346
(Sheldon:)She still believes in Noah
and his amazing zoo boat.

19
00:00:46,377 --> 00:00:47,707
(Sheldon:)This could have all been avoided

20
00:00:47,712 --> 00:00:49,382
(Sheldon:)if you'd only listened to me.

21
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:52,050
(Leonard:)Sheldon,

22
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:54,200
(Amy:)I knew your mother was fine
with us living together

23
00:00:54,197 --> 00:00:58,027
(Amy:)because I already
told her we were.

